      "message": "If `Count \u003d\u003d SkDynamicExtent` we\u0027ll always fail the `sk_collection_check_length` check. Would it better to use a strict `\u003c` in the requires so that callers are required to specify a non-dynamic extent?\n\nOr should the behavior be that if Count \u003d\u003d SkDynamicExtent that it returns the whole span?",
